# Environment Configuration

Create a `.env.local` file in the root directory with the following variables:

```env
# Database
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/krin_edtech"
DIRECT_DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/krin_edtech"

# API
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:3000/api"
NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL="ws://localhost:3000"

# Authentication
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="your-secret-key-here"
PLATFORM_OWNER_EMAIL=andreykosir@gmail.com
PLATFORM_CMS_ACCESS_MODE="owner_only"
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID="your-google-client-id"
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET="your-google-client-secret"
# Google OAuth redirect URI: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/google

# External Services
STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY="pk_test_..."
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY="sk_test_..."
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET="whsec_..."
STRIPE_PRICE_PREMIUM_MONTHLY="price_..."
STRIPE_PRICE_CORPORATE_MONTHLY="price_..."
# Optional annual Stripe Price IDs
STRIPE_PRICE_PREMIUM_YEARLY="price_..."
STRIPE_PRICE_CORPORATE_YEARLY="price_..."

# LiqPay (server-only). Start with sandbox keys.
LIQPAY_PUBLIC_KEY=""
LIQPAY_PRIVATE_KEY=""
LIQPAY_CHECKOUT_URL="https://www.liqpay.ua/api/3/checkout"
LIQPAY_API_URL="https://www.liqpay.ua/api/3/request"
LIQPAY_MODE="sandbox"
# Amounts are in UAH and are resolved only on the server.
LIQPAY_PRICE_PREMIUM_MONTHLY_UAH=""
LIQPAY_PRICE_PREMIUM_YEARLY_UAH=""
LIQPAY_PRICE_CORPORATE_MONTHLY_UAH=""
LIQPAY_PRICE_CORPORATE_YEARLY_UAH=""

# Communications (server-only; `log` is safe for local development)
EMAIL_PROVIDER="log"
EMAIL_API_KEY=""
EMAIL_FROM_DEFAULT=""
EMAIL_FROM_SUPPORT=""
EMAIL_FROM_BILLING=""
EMAIL_FROM_SECURITY=""
EMAIL_REPLY_TO_SUPPORT=""
NOTIFICATION_WORKER_ENABLED="true"
NOTIFICATION_WORKER_SECRET=""
NOTIFICATION_MAX_RETRIES="4"
NOTIFICATION_BATCH_SIZE="25"
WEB_PUSH_PUBLIC_KEY=""
WEB_PUSH_PRIVATE_KEY=""
WEB_PUSH_SUBJECT=""
SUPPORT_MAX_ATTACHMENT_SIZE="5242880"
SUPPORT_ALLOWED_MIME_TYPES="image/png,image/jpeg,application/pdf"

# AI Services
OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."

# Upload
NEXT_PUBLIC_UPLOAD_URL="http://localhost:3000/api/upload"
```

## Production

For production, update these variables in your hosting platform's environment settings.
